  in singapore and you're in the united  states where there's you know much more  significant time uh uh kind of conflict  if you will yeah correct uh uber no  sorry airbnb is a good example where i  think they recently just opened up and  said hey you guys can work from wherever  we just want you know the best talent so  um coinbase they don't have a  headquarters and there's a number of  other companies in the industry that are  pretty much location agnostic and they  just want talent yeah what about pay  like are these jobs paying more than  let's say their counterparts and other  tech companies are they paying more than  like working at like a small business  what do you see there they're paying  enough to lure away the top talent from  a lot of the top companies but um i  think a lot of the job seekers you know  realize the upside you know in potential  equity and things like that um and it's  just much more exciting than wearing a  suit and tie every day and you know  dreading work it's actually more fun  more engaging you're working in an  industry that you believe in and you're  passionate about you know so to answer  your question yes the pay is is good  across the board but also there's the  added benefit of equity and also just  enjoying work in general yeah it does  seem like people are are maybe happier  right and they don't feel like it's as  much of a job as like hey this is fun uh  the pay as you mentioned probably is  higher uh is that what's leading to a  lot of like the brain drain on wall  street if you will as well where  basically people are saying hey i'm  super interested in finance in general  this is a new form of finance or a new  kind of corner of finance uh i can't do  this stuff at my existing job so why not  go get paid to do it you know full-time  yeah i think the the metric that's  exciting to a lot of people is that  overlay of like where we are with  bitcoin adoption in comparison to where  we were with the internet adoption and  people are kind of realizing maybe they  should skate where the puck is going and  not where the puck has been  um so i think people are just you know  waking up to you know this is the future  and everyone's trying to get involved  one way or the other hey you did you  like this video great we make five of  them a day and post them here on this  channel make sure you subscribe like the  video and see you next time

